cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  Cite this software together with the original studies and deposited datasets.
  Save release.json and the exported analysis metadata to identify the exact
  source snapshot, data builds, contrast, and settings used.
type: software
title: HypoExplorer
abstract: >-
  An interactive explorer for hypothalamic transcriptomic studies and local
  reanalyses. Original studies, data deposits, and analysis outputs retain
  separate provenance and reuse terms.
authors:
  - family-names: He
    given-names: Wenyuan
    affiliation: University of Toronto
version: 0.15.0
license: MIT
url: https://hypoexplorer.com
repository-code: https://github.com/DrWenyuanHe/hypoexplorer
keywords:
  - hypothalamus
  - transcriptomics
  - reproducibility
